  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "Apache HttpComponents Client（HttpClient 5）是一个功能完备的 Java HTTP 客户端库，提供同步与异步两种编程模型，支持 HTTP/1.1 和 HTTP/2 协议、TLS/SSL 安全连接、多种认证机制、Cookie 管理、HTTP 缓存、WebSocket 通信、Server-Sent Events（SSE）、Unix 域套接字连接以及可观测性集成（Micrometer/OpenTelemetry）。该库面向需要在 Java 应用中发起 HTTP 请求的开发者，是 Apache HttpComponents 生态的核心客户端组件。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "HTTP 客户端核心",
        "description": "提供同步（Classic）和异步（Async）两种 HTTP 客户端实现，支持 GET/POST/PUT/DELETE/PATCH 等全部 HTTP 方法，包含连接池管理、请求重试、重定向跟踪、路由规划等基础功能。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/impl/classic/",
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/impl/async/",
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/classic/methods/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "TLS/SSL 与安全",
        "description": "提供 SSL/TLS 握手策略、主机名验证、SPKI 证书钉扎、Conscrypt 集成等安全功能，支持自定义 SSL 上下文和信任策略。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/ssl/DefaultClientTlsStrategy.java",
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/ssl/SpkiPinningClientTlsStrategy.java",
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/ssl/ConscryptClientTlsStrategy.java"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "HTTP 认证",
        "description": "支持 Basic、Digest、NTLM、Kerberos/SPNEGO、SCRAM-SHA 等多种 HTTP 认证方案，包含凭据提供者和认证策略框架。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/auth/",
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/impl/auth/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Cookie 与状态管理",
        "description": "实现 RFC 6265 Cookie 规范，支持多种 Cookie 规格（Netscape、RFC 2965 等），提供 Cookie 存储和公共后缀列表（PSL）匹配。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/cookie/",
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/impl/cookie/",
          "httpclient5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/psl/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "HTTP 缓存",
        "description": "实现 RFC 9111 HTTP 缓存语义，支持 Ehcache、Memcached、Caffeine 等多种缓存后端，可充当缓存感知的 HTTP 客户端或透明缓存代理。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5-cache/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/impl/cache/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "WebSocket 客户端",
        "description": "提供 WebSocket 协议客户端实现，支持 WebSocket 帧的发送与接收、心跳保活和连接管理。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5-websocket/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/websocket/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Server-Sent Events（SSE）",
        "description": "提供 SSE 协议客户端实现，支持事件流解析与订阅。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5-sse/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/sse/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Fluent API",
        "description": "提供简洁流畅的 API 封装，使常见 HTTP 请求操作可通过链式调用一行完成。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5-fluent/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/fluent/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "可观测性集成",
        "description": "集成 Micrometer 观测 API 和 OpenTelemetry 追踪桥接，支持 HTTP 请求的指标采集和分布式追踪。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5-observation/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/client5/http/observation/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Jakarta REST Client",
        "description": "提供基于 Jakarta REST（JAX-RS）规范的类型安全 REST 客户端，支持 Jackson JSON 序列化。",
        "evidence": [
          "httpclient5-jakarta-rest-client/src/main/java/"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "domain": "网络通信",
    "target_users": "需要在 Java 应用中发起 HTTP 请求、集成 REST/WebSocket/SSE 服务、或构建 HTTP 缓存代理的开发者"
  },
